{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11209010","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11209010","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1120901001:0":{"text":"휴... 이제 안전해진 건가?","source_cn":"呼……现在是不是安全了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x852228060921401B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1120901002:0":{"text":"그 초코보를 타고 약탈을 일삼는 놈들... 바람의 행진 상단의 동료들은 다 그놈들 때문에 흩어져 버리고 말았어! 다행히 숨을 곳을 찾았으니 망정이지.","source_cn":"那些骑陆行鸟劫掠的混蛋……行进之风商队的同伴都被他们冲...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEC8E82D5783B8B3D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1120901003:0":{"text":"만약 주위에 흩어진 화약이 보이면 가져가서 써. 다 빼앗기고 남은 거니 팔아도 몇 푼 안 될 테니까...","source_cn":"你要是在周围看到散落的火药，就拿去用吧。都是被抢剩下的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4AC419086C80C0EC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1120901004:0":{"text":"지나가던 친구, 고마워. 난 어서 가서 흩어진 상단 멤버를 찾아야겠어. 조반니랑 사람들이 무사하기를!","source_cn":"路过的朋友，谢谢你，我得赶快去找失散的商队成员了，希望...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5A8D67E7FE7DDA31","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:塞拉菲娜":{"text":"세라피나","source":"塞拉菲娜","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":1}}